## 🚀 Setup & Deployment

1. Clone this repo
2. Add your Groq API key as a Streamlit secret named `GROQ_API_KEY`
   (Settings → Secrets)
3. Deploy on [Streamlit Community Cloud](https://share.streamlit.io) with
   `final2.py` as the main file

